 Unreal Engine 5, The Sinking City 2 delivers next-gen visuals with Lumen global illumination, photorealistic Nanite geometry, life-like Metahuman-powered characters, and much more.</li></ul>","developers":["Frogwares"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825860/05f1db0ecea4914621f13ebaa81710e505de2c6b/header.jpg?t=1761138715","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2019-2024. Frogwares Ireland Ltd. All rights reserved. \u201cThe Sinking City\u201d is a registered trademark of Frogwares Ireland Ltd. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2825860/668221/d4e36a27095512f227b2dfbb9aef4fc76521f8ea/1750945083/dash_av1.mpd?t=1709748909","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2825860/668221/d4e36a27095512f227b2dfbb9aef4fc76521f8ea/1750945083/dash_h264.mpd?t=1709748909","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2825860/668221/d4e36a27095512f227b2dfbb9aef4fc76521f8ea/1750945083/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1709748909","id":257004306,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257004306/movie480.mp4?t=1709748909","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257004306/movie_max.mp4?t=1709748909"},"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257004306/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1709748909","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257004306/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1709748909","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257004306/mo